#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Line '%(line)s' returns goods without referencing the order they were sold "
"on. VRP2 accepts a return only against the original receipt: refund it from "
"that order in the POS. (Returned deposit packaging is different: mark the "
"product 'VRP2 Returnable Packaging'.)"
msgstr ""
"Riadok „%(line)s“ vracia tovar bez odkazu na objednávku, na ktorej bol "
"predaný. VRP2 prijme vrátenie tovaru len voči pôvodnému dokladu: vráťte ho z"
" tejto objednávky v POS. (Vrátené zálohované obaly sú iný prípad: označte "
"produkt ako „Zálohovaný obal VRP2“.)"

