#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Packaging '%(product)s' is not in this till's VRP2 catalogue (it has no VRP2"
" service code). Push the catalogue to VRP2 first."
msgstr ""
"Obal „%(product)s“ nie je v katalógu VRP2 tejto pokladne (nemá kód služby "
"VRP2). Najprv odošlite katalóg do VRP2."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Payment method '%(method)s' has no VRP2 payment type. A sale settled on a "
"customer account is not a cash-register sale; set the type on the payment "
"method if it is one."
msgstr ""
"Platobná metóda „%(method)s“ nemá typ platidla VRP2. Predaj uhradený na účet"
" zákazníka nie je tržbou registračnej pokladnice; ak ňou je, nastavte typ na"
" platobnej metóde."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:pos_vrp2.selection__pos_payment_method__vrp2_payment_type__card
msgid "Platobná karta"
msgstr "Platobná karta"

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid ""
"Point of Sale '%(pos)s' does not round cash in VRP2, so Odoo must not round "
"it either: disable Cash Rounding or enable 'Round to 0.05 €'."
msgstr ""
"Miesto predaja „%(pos)s“ nezaokrúhľuje hotovosť vo VRP2, preto ju nesmie "
"zaokrúhľovať ani Odoo: vypnite zaokrúhľovanie hotovosti alebo zapnite "
"„Zaokrúhľovať na 0,05 €“."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_config.py:0
msgid ""
"Point of Sale '%(pos)s' rounds cash to 0.05 € in VRP2, so its Odoo cash "
"rounding must do the same: enable Cash Rounding with a 0.05 'Nearest' "
"rounding method (Add a rounding line) and 'Only apply rounding on cash'."
msgstr ""
"Miesto predaja „%(pos)s“ zaokrúhľuje hotovosť vo VRP2 na 0,05 €, preto musí "
"rovnako zaokrúhľovať aj Odoo: zapnite zaokrúhľovanie hotovosti so spôsobom "
"0,05 „Najbližšie“ („Pridať riadok zaokrúhlenia“) a „Only apply rounding on "
"cash“."

